  - The mirror duplicates part of the contract reader as text, because AC6 allows no new import. It must follow any later change of the reader. If the reader later refuses more, the mirror would keep False for bytes that the reader refuses.
  - The second gap of DEF-0117 (acts outside the path rules) is not closed and stays with the approver.
